|>they be interchanged?

My limited understanding of this area (I've not actually done this...) is that
M9400/M9401 gives you Q18 and M9404/M9405 gives you full Q22.

All I now about the VAX 410x Q-bus expansion is that I've seen the connector
on the back that you plug a cable into. I don't know what the other box is
supposed to be but it sounds like a BA200 series with an appropriate S-box
style card.

I'm not sure that there ever was an option to go from VAX 410x to BA23; I
suspect that FCC requirements and suchlike would have mandated expansion
via BA200 series cabs.

Antonio

