<FONT FACE="Arial" SIZE=2><P><B>RED HAT LINUX: Version 5.0 for Alpha</B>

<P>LINUX makes an excellent workstation and server and has an X Windows

interface available. LINUX is speedy on the DEC Alpha 166 but requires a degree of computer knowledge

