<B><P>DEC UNIX 4.0 (OSF UNIX)</B></P>

<P>DEC UNIX requires both a license (DEC #QL-MT4 AE-6Q - $780) and media (DEC #QA-MT4 AA-H8 - $340) to run.

It also needs at least 64MB of RAM, a one gigabyte hard drive and either a fast CDROM (preferably 8X) or a DEC approved

