> since it has the highest SPECint95 of any existing systems.
> It will be interesting to see how close HP comes to their
> claim of 30 SPECint95 for the 440 MHz PA-8500 and how soon
> it actually ships....

   Early next year is the latest I've heard.  The real question is
   will the huge caches bite HP with a poor frequency yield distrib-
   ution.  BTW, the 7200 and 8000 came up short when first shipped.

