     Even though I have likely spent over 5,000 hours on many RT-11 operating system (probably over 50,000
     hours in total on RT-11 related projects) fixes and enhancements, I think my overall viewpoint is that of a
     hobby user who has found a tiny bit of gold at the end of a rainbow of enjoyment.  Additional goodies like a
     PATH HANDLER and enhancements for the SL: should also be available very soon after Year 2000 patches
     are made available to hobby users.

