DEC 3000 Model 500, 500X, 400 and 300's were all TURBOchannel systems with
21064/21064A chips in them  They were the first Alpha workstation products
from Digital

All of these systems are capable of running VMS and DEC OSF/1 (now Digital
Unix) but were not capable of running Windows NT.

The only box made in that timeframe that was NT capable (as well as VMS and
OSF) was the DEC 2000 series (aka the DECpc AXP150 when running Windows NT)


