5 +5V
other pins NC

It's 4800 bps, 1 start bit, 1 stop bit, odd parity.
It has 2 modes, polled and non-polled.  It accepts 1 byte commands to
switch modes, poll it or reset it.  I believe "T" resets it,
"D", "P", "R", "S", "s" do something but I don't know what.

-Mike



