Another indicator is its growth rate (lines of code; not copies sold).
Even more difficult that bringing an existing body of code under control
is trying to do that while others are changing it to add new features.

If you remember the original days of Alpha VMS, it was aimed at a feature
set equivalent to not-the-latest VAX VMS, because they needed to get a
